 Form Number: BI-947 (G.P.-S. 017-0113)  
 Title: APPLICATION FOR A PERMANENT RESIDENCE PERMIT  
 Issuing Authority: Department of Home Affairs, Republic of South Africa  
 Legal Basis: Sections 26 and 27 of Act No. 13 of 2002: Regulation 33  
 For Official Use Only:
 List of applicants table: Ref No, Surname, Forenames, Date of birth, Gender, Relationship, Applicable section of Act, Permit number  
 Persons interviewed checkboxes: Applicant, Spouse, Other  
 Interview metadata: Place, Date of interview/capturing, Users BBS No., Rank, Interviewing officer, Persal No.  
 Application processing: Presented by officer, Considered by, Date of consideration, Approved/Rejected, Reasons for rejection, Conditions, Signature, Date, Rank, Office Stamp  
 Section 1: Details of Principal Applicant:
 1.1 Title  
 1.2 Surname  
 1.3 First name(s)  
 1.4 Maiden name  
 1.5 Other former surnames  
 1.6 Date of birth (Year, Month, Day)  
 1.7 Country of birth  
 1.8 Nationality at birth  
 1.9 Present nationality  
 1.10 Passport No., Issued by (country), Expiry date  
 1.11 Marital status: Never married, Married, Permanent spousal relationship, Divorced, Widowed, Legally separated  
 1.12 Type of marriage/relationship: Civil marriage, Customary marriage, Notarial contract  
 1.13 Date of marriage/notarial contract concluded (Year, Month, Day)  
 1.14 Details of previous marriage(s)/spousal relationship(s): Commencement date/place, Divorce date/place, Custody/maintenance details  
 1.15 Present residential address, Suburb/City/Town, Country, Since date  
 1.16 Postal address, Suburb, City, Code  
 1.17 Contact: Tel. No. Home, Tel. No. Work, E-mail address  
 1.18 Occupation  
 1.19 Type of temporary residence permit held  
 1.20 Valid until, Issuing office  
 Section 2: Details of Principal Applicant's Parents:
 2.1 Father: Surname, First name(s), Birth place (City/Town, State/Province, Country), Date of birth, Nationality at birth  
