 Section 3: Details of Applicant's Spouse (If Applicable):
 3.1-3.5 Title, Surname, First name(s), Other former surnames, Date of birth  
 3.6 Previous marriage/relationship details & child custody/maintenance payments  
 3.7-3.11 Birth place, State/Province, Country of birth, Nationality at birth, Present nationality  
 3.12 Passport No./SA Identity No., Issued by, Expiry date  
 3.13-3.15 Present residential address, Since date, Postal address, Suburb, Code  
 3.16-3.19 Tel Home/Work, E-mail, Occupation, Temporary residence permit type, Issuing office, Expiry date  
 Section 4: Details of Spouse's Parents:
 4.1 Father: Surname, First name(s), Birth place, Country, Date of birth, Nationality at birth  
 4.2 Mother: Surname, First name(s), Maiden name, Birth place, Country, Date of birth, Nationality at birth  
 Section 5: Details of Biological or Legally Adopted Children:
 Table capturing: Surname, Forename(s), Date of birth, Relationship to applicant/spouse, Country and place of birth, Present nationality, Occupation  
 Sections 6 & 7: Non-Applying / Dependent Children:
 Section 6: Names of unmarried children under 21 who do not wish to apply and reasons  
 Section 7: Names of children over 21 who are still dependent and reasons for dependency  
 Section 8: Relatives and/or Friends Resident in South Africa:
 Table capturing: Name, Address, Tel number, Relationship/Acquaintanceship, ID No., Permanent/Temporary Residence No  
 Section 9: Employment Record & Financial Details:
 Employment record table: Name of employer, Address, From/To dates, Nature of work  
 Present/last duties (Principal applicant, Spouse)  
 Intended occupation in SA (Principal applicant, Spouse)  
